.TH BOOT 1 "August 2026" "runv7" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
boot.py \- boot a V6/V7 disk image headlessly on simh
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B boot.py
.RB [ \-\-ini " file" ]
.RB [ \-\-boot " seq" ]
.RB [ \-\-cmd " command" ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B boot.py
starts simh with an
.B .ini
config and drives its console over the telnet listener, walking the given
boot sequence, then optionally runs a command and captures the output.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-ini " file"
simh config (default
.BR headless.ini ).
.TP
.BI \-\-boot " seq"
console boot sequence
.IR SEND > EXPECT |...
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fetch (1)
